column-top-margin'     ><p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-93bxxm-461237841fac3f3315a3754f28011368\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-461237841fac3f3315a3754f28011368{\npadding-bottom:20px;\nfont-size:40px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-461237841fac3f3315a3754f28011368 .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-461237841fac3f3315a3754f28011368 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:40px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-461237841fac3f3315a3754f28011368 .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-461237841fac3f3315a3754f28011368 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-461237841fac3f3315a3754f28011368 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-93bxxm-461237841fac3f3315a3754f28011368 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-14  el_before_av_hr  avia-builder-el-first  av-inherit-size'><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Envases<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><br \/>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-8vz72i-4591fb7f6513e2fed5b15f92cc3251a7\">\n#top .hr.av-8vz72i-4591fb7f6513e2fed5b15f92cc3251a7{\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-8vz72i-4591fb7f6513e2fed5b15f92cc3251a7 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-8vz72i-4591fb7f6513e2fed5b15f92cc3251a7 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-15  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_textblock  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><br \/>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-8gqcky-ac4fc8f8eb40153648667fd2f2312670 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Producimos envases de polietileno de alta presi\u00f3n aplicando la tecnolog\u00eda de extrusi\u00f3n soplado. Fabricamos los envases HDPE para nuestro propio uso, as\u00ed como los ofrecemos a la venta. Producimos envases de capacidad de 0,5L, 1L, 4L, 5L, 7L, 10L y 20L.<\/p>\n<p>La maquinaria moderna y el personal cualificado con una gran experiencia garantizan la m\u00e1xima calidad de envases fabricados. A nuestros clientes les ofrecimos la posibilidad de elegir el color de envases, as\u00ed como la personalizaci\u00f3n para marcas propias (marca blanca). Adem\u00e1s, podemos producir envases con el logotipo del cliente o el nombre de la empresa en relieve.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/p><\/div><\/p>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-aerdae-036e9fe60b5057638ce54101670c70b0\">\n.flex_column.av-aerdae-036e9fe60b5057638ce54101670c70b0{\nborder-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;\npadding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='flex_column av-aerdae-036e9fe60b5057638ce54101670c70b0 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-17  el_after_av_one_half  el_before_av_one_half  flex_column_div av-zero-column-padding  column-top-margin'     ><p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyg90e6w-ec3142fac1b3406e81b2bab76c11a1d2\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-ec3142fac1b3406e81b2bab76c11a1d2{\npadding-bottom:20px;\nfont-size:40px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-ec3142fac1b3406e81b2bab76c11a1d2 .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-ec3142fac1b3406e81b2bab76c11a1d2 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:40px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-ec3142fac1b3406e81b2bab76c11a1d2 .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-ec3142fac1b3406e81b2bab76c11a1d2 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-ec3142fac1b3406e81b2bab76c11a1d2 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-lyg90e6w-ec3142fac1b3406e81b2bab76c11a1d2 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-18  el_before_av_hr  avia-builder-el-first  av-inherit-size'><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Envasado<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><br \/>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-97fvba-cfa9c6e567ff88280ef095df6dd27fba\">\n#top .hr.av-97fvba-cfa9c6e567ff88280ef095df6dd27fba{\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-97fvba-cfa9c6e567ff88280ef095df6dd27fba .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-97fvba-cfa9c6e567ff88280ef095df6dd27fba hr-custom  avia-builder-el-19  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_textblock  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><br \/>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyg90ou3-15b1744a7974424a9a302f50ee91c78d '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>El envasado y embalaje de nuestros productos se realiza en l\u00edneas de llenado y envasado modernas, automatizadas y robotizadas. Disponemos de tres l\u00edneas de llenado y envasado completamente automatizadas y de gran productividad, as\u00ed como tres l\u00edneas semiautom\u00e1ticas. Nuestro personal hace todo lo posible para garantizar que nuestros productos est\u00e9n envasados de manera est\u00e9tica, durable y bien marcada.<\/p>\n<p>Los productos que salen de nuestra f\u00e1brica est\u00e1n protegidos por sellado de inducci\u00f3n. Todas las operaciones de producci\u00f3n est\u00e1n supervisadas por un programa inform\u00e1tico de tipo PMS (production managment system).<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/p><\/div>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-6x6u3a-70185925ab1605c0ac096fde76fa716e\">\n.flex_column.av-6x6u3a-70185925ab1605c0ac096fde76fa716e{\nborder-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;\npadding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='flex_column av-6x6u3a-70185925ab1605c0ac096fde76fa716e av_one_half  avia-builder-el-21  el_after_av_one_half  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_div av-zero-column-padding  column-top-margin'     ><p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyg919jt-45c01dd1ad673dd883e0234e47216042\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-45c01dd1ad673dd883e0234e47216042{\npadding-bottom:20px;\nfont-size:40px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-45c01dd1ad673dd883e0234e47216042 .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-45c01dd1ad673dd883e0234e47216042 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:40px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-45c01dd1ad673dd883e0234e47216042 .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-45c01dd1ad673dd883e0234e47216042 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-45c01dd1ad673dd883e0234e47216042 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-lyg919jt-45c01dd1ad673dd883e0234e47216042 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-22  el_before_av_hr  avia-builder-el-first  av-inherit-size'><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Mezcla<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><br \/>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-5moo12-de410cde88bc16a3984cb8d7170bb2f0\">\n#top .hr.av-5moo12-de410cde88bc16a3984cb8d7170bb2f0{\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-5moo12-de410cde88bc16a3984cb8d7170bb2f0 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-5moo12-de410cde88bc16a3984cb8d7170bb2f0 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-23  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_textblock  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><br \/>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyg91v0k-bcaf76031651a632c37fab3e63912be6 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>La producci\u00f3n de aceites se lleva a cabo en una planta de mezcla moderna y automatizada equipada con 7 mezcladores con el sistema de calentamiento, dosificaci\u00f3n y filtraci\u00f3n.<\/p>\n<p>Dosificaci\u00f3n de materias primas y traslado de productos finales de la planta de mezcla se realiza mediante el sistema PIGING. El sistema PIGING se basa en pistones impulsados por aire comprimido situados en el interior de la tuber\u00eda.<br \/>\nEsto garantiza repetibilidad de producci\u00f3n y la limpieza de productos, puesto que despu\u00e9s de cada operaci\u00f3n las tuber\u00edas interiores se vac\u00edan y se limpian.<\/p>\n<p>Esto nos asegura de que las materias primas se pesan con precisi\u00f3n y previene que se mezclen productos diferentes. Todo el proceso de mezcla est\u00e1 supervisado por el personal cualificado.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/p><\/div>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-42zzti-e7264b2bbdc095bd0fd54145835c3084\">\n.flex_column.av-42zzti-e7264b2bbdc095bd0fd54145835c3084{\nborder-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;\npadding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='flex_column av-42zzti-e7264b2bbdc095bd0fd54145835c3084 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-25  el_after_av_one_half  avia-builder-el-last  flex_column_div av-zero-column-padding  column-top-margin'     ><p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyg92c79-b3cf037a774a1e3c082c76451be71d01\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-b3cf037a774a1e3c082c76451be71d01{\npadding-bottom:20px;\nfont-size:40px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-b3cf037a774a1e3c082c76451be71d01 .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-b3cf037a774a1e3c082c76451be71d01 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:40px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-b3cf037a774a1e3c082c76451be71d01 .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-b3cf037a774a1e3c082c76451be71d01 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-b3cf037a774a1e3c082c76451be71d01 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-lyg92c79-b3cf037a774a1e3c082c76451be71d01 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-26  el_before_av_hr  avia-builder-el-first  av-inherit-size'><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Almac\u00e9n<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><br \/>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-31egyu-6f514170fdfc52417e6422db57280393\">\n#top .hr.av-31egyu-6f514170fdfc52417e6422db57280393{\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-31egyu-6f514170fdfc52417e6422db57280393 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-31egyu-6f514170fdfc52417e6422db57280393 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-27  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_textblock  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><br \/>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyg92ooy-1a5e556eccbdbd40585a0e4d2f43e22f '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Tenemos varios almacenes de capacidad total de 4500 espacios para pal\u00e9s. En diferentes zonas de almac\u00e9n se introdujeron varios sistemas que apoyan los procesos de almacenamiento, tales como: sistema de estanter\u00edas de entrada (drive-in rack), sistema de estanter\u00edas con plataformas controladas por radio (radioshuttle) y sistema de estanter\u00edas m\u00f3viles (mooving racks). Todos los sistemas son asociados al programa de tipo SGA (WMS &#8211; warehouse managment system), que garantiza que los productos se almacenan adecuadamente y su distribuci\u00f3n es completamente trazable.<\/p>\n<p>Para gestionar el almac\u00e9n utilizamos montacargas confiables de las marcas STILL, HYSTER<br \/>\ny JUNGHEINRICH. La operaci\u00f3n de toda la maquinaria se basa en el principio de electromovilidad, favoreciendo el cuidado del medio ambiente.<\/p>\n<p>Nos especializamos en carga de contenedores mar\u00edtimos, lo que requiere soluciones espec\u00edficas y alta precisi\u00f3n en el proceso de colocaci\u00f3n de la mercanc\u00eda dentro del contenedor.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/p><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent":4315,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-4329","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4329","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4329"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4329\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5621,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4329\/revisions\/5621"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4315"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4329"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}